# Keep the Docker build context small and reproducible: everything is (re)built
# inside the image, so node_modules and prior build output must never be shipped.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/out
**/.astro
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/.vite
**/*.tsbuildinfo

.git
**/.github
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store

# The desktop app is packaged by its own CI (Windows runner), never in a server image.
exyconn-tracker-app/dist
exyconn-tracker-app/out

# Local env files must not leak into images; real values come from GitHub secrets.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
